        <param name="request">Represents the HTTP CONNECT request that will be sent to the proxy. This value cannot be null.</param>
        <summary>Called before sending an HTTP CONNECT request to the proxy to establish a tunnel.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called before sending an HTTP CONNECT request to the proxy to establish a tunnel.</para>
          <para>Allows manipulating, or canceling, said request before sending it to the proxy. Refer to Request to learn how a request can be manipulated/canceled.</para>
